		"Changes for various rituals (the Blood Magic guide book may provide outdated information):\n\n§2-§r §lRitual of Containment§r: Maximum size increased to a 300-block radius.\n\n§2-§r §lLaying of the Filler§r: Places blocks each tick and requires only 1 LP per operation.\n\n§2-§r §lCall of the Zephyr§r: Maximum radius is 255 blocks, gathers items 2 times per second.\n\n§2-§r §lMark of the Falling Tower§r: Raw Will actually increases meteor radius by up to 25%%. Doesn't reset activation - can be automated!"
